Subject: [PATCH 01/19] =?UTF-8?q?fix(umdr41=20=C2=A75):=20P0=20correctness?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20detected=5Ftype=20UnboundLocalError,=20OAuth=20r?=
 =?UTF-8?q?edirect=20URI=20corruption,=20annotation=20resolution,=20Unifie?=
 =?UTF-8?q?dLogger=20contract?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- recon/principal_provisioning.py: derive detected_type BEFORE the loop and
  per-principal (first candidate's auth_type), fixing the UnboundLocalError on
  the first unsupported principal and stale loop-carried values. Requested vs
  detected distinction and unsupported_auth_type behavior preserved.
- families/execution_plans.py: replace lstrip('https://') with urlsplit-based
  _attacker_origin/_attacker_path helpers (hostnames starting h/t/p/s intact,
  IPv6 brackets, userinfo dropped, ports kept, non-http(s) schemes rejected);
  percent-encode authorize query params exactly once via quote().
- shared/legacy_disposition.py: import Iterable (get_type_hints NameError).
- shared/cve_advisory.py: direct Hypothesis import (no cycle) so the string
  annotation resolves under get_type_hints.
- shared/generic_web_contracts.py: direct VerificationResult import.
- production/production_spine.py: drop Final[int] annotation on MAX_STAGES
  (TypeError under get_type_hints); constant value unchanged.
- verification/robust.py: document UnifiedLogger (module, message) contract;
  add stdlib-name delegates (warning/critical/info/debug) with the SAME arity.
- tests/test_umdr41_p0_correctness.py: 22 regression tests covering all the
  above (crash cases, stale-state, hostname preservation, encoding round-trip,
  negative-control semantics, annotation resolution, logger arity).
