  PROMOTED/ABANDONED terminal ids of this batch) — the same upsert-by-id
  result merge_hypotheses will produce — instead of the bare
  updated_hypotheses list. An empty update batch no longer reports every
  open hypothesis as 'distinguished'. New metadata fields
  updated_in_batch/_count separate reducer-upsert accounting from
  resolved-out-of-pool accounting.
- decision ledger snapshot: unchanged (the fix is at the caller).
- tests/test_umdr41_rc6_rc7.py: pins the directive's false-positive
  scenario (empty update list != everything resolved), terminal-vs-deferred
  semantics, RC-7 original-rank semantics and bounded idless-skipping.
