+# UMDR41 Discovery Intelligence Report
+## RC-6 information gain — CORRECTED (commit e674da2)
+Defect confirmed: pool_after was the bare `updated_hypotheses` list (promote/abandon/retag updates), so (a) an EMPTY update batch reported every open hypothesis as distinguished — the directive's exact false-positive — and (b) DEFER/rabbit-hole retags were counted as resolutions. Fix: pool_after = before-pool minus PROMOTED/ABANDONED ids (the same upsert-by-id result the merge_hypotheses reducer produces); new metadata `updated_in_batch`/_count separates reducer upserts from out-of-pool resolutions. Pinned by test_umdr41_rc6_rc7.py (the false-positive scenario, terminal-vs-deferred). Naming honesty: the measure remains a discriminative-ID-count difference (the ledger's `distinguished`), NOT entropy — no calibrated probabilities exist yet, so no entropy label was applied (directive §10.1).
+## RC-7 challenger model — verified current state, gap documented
+ranked_alternatives() records per-decision runner-ups (id, score, original rank, bounded k=5, self-exclusion, idless skipped) and rides on per-candidate coverage entries. GAP (not fixed this window): alternatives do not SURVIVE across research cycles (per-batch only) and rejection-reason capture is one-line (reason field) rather than the directive's full model (unavailability reason, previous outcomes, reranking history) — queued as REMEDIATION_PLAN P2.7.
+## RC-5 semantic dedup — assessed
+hypothesis_content_fingerprint = sha256 over (normalized-lowercased URL, lowercased vuln_class); wired at builder.py:2055 as generation-time id replacement (frozen files untouched). Directive §10.3 concerns stand as design notes for a future window: full-URL lowercasing merges case-sensitive paths; method/principal/tenant dimensions not in the fingerprint. NOT changed here (fingerprint contract is wired into the reducer's id semantics; changing it needs a pool-migration plan).
+## Identity research & family coverage — inventory state
+advisory_hypothesis_to_state_hypothesis (cve_advisory) now annotation-resolvable (5.3 fix); its wiring into target_understanding agent verified (line 556/571). Families: execution plans exist for race_condition, tenant_isolation, multi_step_auth_bypass, oauth (all with negative controls — oauth plan now correctly built, F-003); business_logic/exploit_chain composed from feeders at runtime. Controlled end-to-end family validation: NOT performed (requires lab targets — §12 gate).
