1. umdr38_1 provenance: BUILD_INFO pointed at upstream-only shas
   (fe92f178/9802cd22) that never existed in this branch — red since
   UMDR38-1. (BUILD_INFO change itself follows in an isolated
   'BUILD_INFO re-freeze' commit per the UM-DR-36.1 isolation rule.)
2. sprint_i1 s2 composition: subprocess spawned without PYTHONPATH lost
   the package in any non-installed env. Env now forwarded. 10/10 green.
3. campaign_pack + blind_discovery: same subprocess-path wiring defect,
   same fix. 33/33 green.
4. cli_doctor: _check_version hard-failed when webpent not installed as
