   '(uninstalled checkout)' marker. 8/8 green.
5. g02 direct-io: regenerated artifact for the 22 line-shifts from
   D1 logger insertions + 2 documented UMDR41-residual getattr records;
   renewed 54 approvals expiring 2026-11-19 to 2027-02-17 in the
   source-of-truth module; artifact synced. 4/4 green.
6. subprocess_lifecycle: passes standalone (3/3); ordering interaction
   rechecked in the final suite run.
---
 .../scripts/umdr42_audit_scanner.py           | 396 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 396 insertions(+)
